[[File:Ferocious gloves detail.png|left|130px]]
The '''ferocious gloves''' are a pair of [[melee]] [[gloves]] requiring level 80 [[Attack]] and [[Defence]] to equip. They are the [[Armour/Highest bonuses|best-in-slot]] offensive gloves for melee, surpassing [[Barrows gloves]]. However, they provide no defensive stats, and have a negative ranged and magic attack bonuses, making them less effective when using multiple attack styles. 

The gloves are untradeable, but can be made from a piece of [[hydra leather]], costing {{Coins|{{GEP|Hydra leather}}}} on the [[Grand Exchange]]. To craft the gloves, player must bring the leather and a [[hammer]] to the northern part of the [[Lithkren Vault]], and use the leather on the [[machinery]] south-west of the pool. In order to revert the gloves back to leather form, simply use the [[machinery]] again while holding a [[hammer]] and the gloves. Players must complete [[Dragon Slayer II]] to access the vault. [[File:Ferocious gloves creation.gif|right|thumb|The player crafting the gloves]]
